  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING COMMUNITY ORGANISATIONS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEUDES (Democratic Development Units Corporation) is a flexible NGO based on a consortium of 18 social science professionals running a number of programmes with minimum infrastructure.  The basic premise is democracy, which means participatory management and a perspective of changing the grossly unequal distribution of power and wealth in Colombia.  In the present situation of conflict, CEUDES works with several of the civil society peace networks. A particular emphasis is support and training for women heads of households.

This project received funding from Latin American Children&apos;s Trust - LACT - a mayor donor.</narrative>
  </description>
